cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "paper-repro-auditor: automated reproducibility checklist for publications"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: Yenula-W
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-03
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Yenula-W/paper-repro-auditor"
abstract: >-
  paper-audit reads a paper (DOI, arXiv id or PDF), finds its data and code
  availability statements and links, checks that the links resolve, that code is
  archived, licensed and versioned, runs light repository checks, and writes a
  Markdown + JSON checklist report.
keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - research software
  - open science
  - data availability
